# Protected review notes

- Treat `review-notes/**` as read-only user-approved requirements.
- Read the relevant note before implementing MCP optimization, exception handling, selection, or Cross Probe changes.
- Never create, modify, rename, move, or delete anything under `review-notes/**` unless the user explicitly requests that exact notes update.
- Implement code and normal documentation changes outside `review-notes/**`.
- If implementation reveals a conflict, report it to the user; do not silently rewrite the protected note.
